#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Virtualization Engine
#  File: virtualization_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS virtualization engine responsible for:
#      • VM lifecycle management
#      • hypercall routing
#      • virtual CPU scheduling
#      • virtual memory mapping
#      • isolation enforcement
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [VM Lifecycle](ca://s?q=Explain_VM_Lifecycle)
#    - [Hypercall Routing](ca://s?q=Explain_Hypercall_Routing)
#    - [vCPU Scheduling](ca://s?q=Explain_vCPU_Scheduling)
#    - [Virtual Memory](ca://s?q=Explain_Virtual_Memory)
#    - [Isolation Boundaries](ca://s?q=Explain_VM_Isolation)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - create_vm(name, vcpu, memory_mb)
#         Creates VM instance.
#
#    - start_vm(vm_id)
#         Starts VM.
#
#    - stop_vm(vm_id)
#         Stops VM.
#
#    - destroy_vm(vm_id)
#         Deletes VM.
#
#    - register_hypercall(name, handler)
#         Registers hypercall.
#
#    - hypercall(name, payload)
#         Executes hypercall.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns virtualization engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  VM STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "VM-XXXX",
#      "name": "sandbox.vm",
#      "vcpu": 2,
#      "memory_mb": 1024,
#      "state": "running/stopped",
#      "created": <epoch>
#    }
#
